WEBVTT

00:05:28.783 --> 00:05:31.047
that we did not accept or condone

00:05:31.071 --> 00:05:33.527
his behavior or rhetoric
during the election.

00:05:34.065 --> 00:05:36.623
CQ: So I'm already feeling
kind of aggravated,

00:05:36.647 --> 00:05:41.060
and then I see this Facebook from Lauran
pop up in my social media feed.

00:05:41.084 --> 00:05:42.091
(Laughter)

00:05:42.115 --> 00:05:45.432
Seeing Lauran's sons at the march
and holding signs

00:05:45.456 --> 00:05:48.750
took it to a new level for me,
and not in a good way,

00:05:48.774 --> 00:05:50.370
because I know these boys,

00:05:50.394 --> 00:05:51.830
I love these boys,

00:05:51.854 --> 00:05:53.736
and I didn't feel they were old enough

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.672
to understand what the march stood for.

00:05:55.696 --> 00:05:57.743
I didn't understand
why Lauran would choose

00:05:57.767 --> 00:05:59.560
to have them participate in that way,

00:05:59.584 --> 00:06:02.908
and I assumed it wasn't a choice
that the boys made for themselves.